{"id":"gch-fig-002","s":"chemistry","t":"4.6.1.1","lv":3,"q":"The graph shows gas made in a reaction. A tangent is drawn at P, where the time is 20 s. What is the rate of reaction at 20 s?","o":["3.0 cm³/s","2.25 cm³/s","0.67 cm³/s","1.5 cm³/s"],"a":3,"x":"Read two points on the tangent: (0, 30) and (40, 90). Gradient = (90 − 30) ÷ (40 − 0) = 1.5 cm³/s. This is the rate at 20 s.","w":["Divided the volume at P by 20 s. That gives the mean rate from the start, not the rate at 20 s.","Used 90 ÷ 40 and forgot that the tangent starts at 30 cm³, not 0.","Turned the gradient upside down by doing change in time ÷ change in volume.",""],"fig":{"type":"graph","x":[0,80],"y":[0,120],"xstep":10,"ystep":30,"xlabel":"time / s","ylabel":"volume of gas / cm³","lines":[{"pts":[[0.0,0.0],[0.5,2.926829],[1.0,5.714286],[1.5,8.372093],[2.0,10.909091],[2.5,13.333333],[3.0,15.652174],[3.5,17.87234],[4.0,20.0],[4.5,22.040816],[5.0,24.0],[5.5,25.882353],[6.0,27.692308],[6.5,29.433962],[7.0,31.111111],[7.5,32.727273],[8.0,34.285714],[8.5,35.789474],[9.0,37.241379],[9.5,38.644068],[10.0,40.0],[10.5,41.311475],[11.0,42.580645],[11.5,43.809524],[12.0,45.0],[12.5,46.153846],[13.0,47.272727],[13.5,48.358209],[14.0,49.411765],[14.5,50.434783],[15.0,51.428571],[15.5,52.394366],[16.0,53.333333],[16.5,54.246575],[17.0,55.135135],[17.5,56.0],[18.0,56.842105],[18.5,57.662338],[19.0,58.461538],[19.5,59.240506],[20.0,60.0],[20.5,60.740741],[21.0,61.463415],[21.5,62.168675],[22.0,62.857143],[22.5,63.529412],[23.0,64.186047],[23.5,64.827586],[24.0,65.454545],[24.5,66.067416],[25.0,66.666667],[25.5,67.252747],[26.0,67.826087],[26.5,68.387097],[27.0,68.93617],[27.5,69.473684],[28.0,70.0],[28.5,70.515464],[29.0,71.020408],[29.5,71.515152],[30.0,72.0],[30.5,72.475248],[31.0,72.941176],[31.5,73.398058],[32.0,73.846154],[32.5,74.285714],[33.0,74.716981],[33.5,75.140187],[34.0,75.555556],[34.5,75.963303],[35.0,76.363636],[35.5,76.756757],[36.0,77.142857],[36.5,77.522124],[37.0,77.894737],[37.5,78.26087],[38.0,78.